# The Engine's managed environment (#893, ADR 0018): what no profile's .env may change. A profile's .env is loaded over
# the Engine's own environment, and the Owner's Engine dashboard writes it (#871); this file is loaded after it, and a
# key named here is one the Engine never saves into a profile (hermes_cli/env_loader.py _apply_managed_env,
# hermes_cli/config.py env_write_refusal). The path is the one scripts/engine-template.yml mounts it at.
#
# The file tools' write root: an Agent's files are written only under the work folder, which is the sandbox's (#390).
HERMES_WRITE_SAFE_ROOT=/work
